{
 "_note": "Design 19, the living land (design-runs/sep24-plan/LAND-ENGINE.md). One pass over the map every game minute, sliced over passTicks steps. perMinute and perMinuteArea: the change cap, the larger of perMinute and round(tiles / perMinuteArea) changes a minute across the whole map. brushHoldMin: game minutes a tile she painted is hers before the land may change it. clime: heat and cold are derived from the map (tiles within radius carrying these tags). keepBand: how far a kept tag's tile count may wander from its baseline (A2b). rules: the land rules, phase B.",
